      "side": 1,
      "message": "YAGNI\n\nThere is currently no need to write tests in other packages. The tests here guarantee that failures elsewhere will cause build breakages, which is already a clearer, stronger signal than a test failure.\n\nThe whole point of the license and license_kind feature is to make it cross-cutting and unavoidable so that OSPO can have confidence that the results are complete and accurate.",
